<title>JORDAN: Jordan average dinar o/nite rates rise to 5.09 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan average dinar o/nite rates rise to 5.09 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 5.09 percent on Monday from 4.45 percent on Sunday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said five banks traded in eleven reported transactions worth 15 million dinars ($21 million) in deals concluded in a 6.0 percent to 4.5 percent range.</p>
<p>$1 = 0.709 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
